    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Armor refers to items of clothing players can wear which reduces damage taken from physical, fire, frost and lightning damage types. See Damage mechanics for damage mitigation formula. See Accessories for non-damage-reducing clothing."
